  data: {
    LLM: 'Partnerships bid for the right to name trump; the bidding team must meet their contract by combining meld points and trick points. First partnership to reach the agreed target score (e.g. 1500) wins.\n\nEach hand has three phases: auction (players bid; high bidder declares trump), melding (all players show melds; points counted), and trick play (high bidder leads; follow suit; trump wins if unable to follow). Trick points plus meld must meet or exceed the bid or the team is set (bid subtracted).',
